

Thanks for that information! Some advice if you haven't used ABBS before.

Pressing a single question mark at just about any of the prompts will
give you a menu of choices or an explanation of what your options are
at any time. The HELP command (press 'H' and then 'enter') may also be
used to get general assistance.

If you're not 100% sure: just keep pressing enter, the system will take
you on a tour of the more recent messages that have been left on the
system and you don't have to enter a single command!

Let's hope you remembered your password, because that's what you will need
next time you dial us up!

